-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Scenario map (request_id -> what it demonstrates)
--   request 1: SHORTLISTED same-district match exists in Chennai, so the outer rings are not used
--   request 2: SHORTLISTED nothing in Madurai; falls back to Tamil Nadu even though Delhi holds a 6/6
--   request 3: SHORTLISTED nothing in Kerala; falls back to the national ring
--   request 4: APPROVED    no compatible unit anywhere in India
--   request 5: ALLOCATED   allocated, transplant not yet scheduled
--   request 6: SCHEDULED   transplant scheduled
--   request 7: COMPLETED   completed, engrafted
--   request 8: COMPLETED   completed with complications, national match
--   request 9: PENDING     background request
--   request 10: PENDING     background request
--   request 11: PENDING     background request
--   request 12: REJECTED    background request
--   request 13: CANCELLED   background request
--   requests 14-420: bulk data across every status
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
